# Security

- Never commit `.env`, API secrets, service_role keys, or real customer data.
- OpenAI / provider keys stay server-side (Edge Functions / Deno env only).
- PIN stays hashed (`pinSecurity`); PIN is outside `APP_DATA_KEYS`.
- Ask a human before changing auth, PIN/AppLock, Supabase contracts, or encryption.
- AI payloads must avoid structured PII (cliente, telefono, email, CF, P.IVA, IBAN).
- Soft-delete via cestino — do not convert to hard-delete without approval.
